+    Returns ``(loss_tensor, normal_loss_value)`` where *loss_tensor* is
+    already multiplied by the (warmed-up) weight and *normal_loss_value* is
+    the unweighted normal-consistency scalar for telemetry.
+    """
+    weight = getattr(opt, "plane_normal_loss_weight", 0.0)
+    if weight == 0.0:
